"""Phase 13 governed coach content (data/seed/coach.json, owner_phase "13") and its three explanatory figures.

  SCENARIOS   8 practice-scenario templates: slots (bilingual option lists) + scenario text + task + rubric (criteria with
              key terms in both languages). Filled deterministically from a seed by src/domain/coach.mjs → generateScenario.
              A generated scenario is always labelled "generated practice"; it is never an exam question.
  INTERVIEW   31 interview questions, one per competency of the framework: prompt, follow-up, three key points with key terms.
              Question sets are derived from a role's competency targets (CIA roles and company-defined roles alike).
  FIGS        3 figures placed as coach:main / coach:labels / coach:interview.

Original CIA wording. No clause numbers, fees, exam facts, pass marks or other official requirements appear here: the coach
never states one. No accreditation, certification-authority or hiring-decision wording. Author: مدثر سلامه."""


def T(en, ar):
    return {"en": en, "ar": ar}


def K(en, ar):
    """Key terms (lower-case stems) used for the keyword-based practice check."""
    return {"en": en, "ar": ar}


def crit(cid, en, ar, hint_en, hint_ar, terms_en, terms_ar):
    return {"id": cid, "criterion": T(en, ar), "hint": T(hint_en, hint_ar), "terms": K(terms_en, terms_ar)}


